WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.483 --> 00:00:21.090
Here is the new term’s list, in a spreadsheet.

2
00:00:21.090 --> 00:00:27.322
Last name, first name, phone — a header row is fine.

3
00:00:27.322 --> 00:00:39.578
Select the three columns and copy them.

4
00:00:39.578 --> 00:00:43.399
Everything an instructor does starts from the kiosk.

5
00:00:43.399 --> 00:00:50.813
Tap Management, in the row under the two big buttons.

6
00:00:50.813 --> 00:00:54.007
The panel is behind your instructor PIN.

7
00:00:54.007 --> 00:00:58.227
Face ID is the shortcut — the PIN is what actually opens it.

8
00:00:58.227 --> 00:01:03.888
Type your PIN.

9
00:01:03.888 --> 00:01:09.382
Then tap Unlock.

10
00:01:09.382 --> 00:01:15.119
This is the Instructor Panel: Records, Add New and Export.

11
00:01:15.119 --> 00:01:21.080
Open the Add New tab.

12
00:01:21.080 --> 00:01:26.876
Tap Paste Columns.

13
00:01:26.876 --> 00:01:33.008
The iPad asks “Allow Paste?” the first time. Allow it.

14
00:01:33.008 --> 00:01:39.487
Every row lands in its own cells. The header was skipped.

15
00:01:39.487 --> 00:01:45.206
Each row is checked before anyone is enrolled.

16
00:01:45.206 --> 00:01:51.927
All three are Ready. Tap Enroll.

17
00:01:51.927 --> 00:01:59.400
Done. They can check in at the kiosk straight away.
